sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Service as TaxReportService
    participant Cmd as UploadCommand
    participant Entry as ExpenseEntry (Domain)
    participant State as OpenState
    participant Store as StorageService
    participant Repo as MetadataRepository

    Note over Client, Service: Richiesta Upload (TaxReport 2.0)

    Client->>Service: uploadDocument(id, type, stream)
    activate Service

    Note right of Service: 1. Command Creation
    Service->>Cmd: new UploadCommand(id, type, stream)
    Service->>Cmd: execute()
    activate Cmd

    Cmd->>Repo: findById(id)
    Repo-->>Cmd: ExpenseStateDTO
    Cmd->>Entry: fromDTO(dto) (Reidratazione)

    Note right of Cmd: 2. Domain Logic Delegation
    Cmd->>Entry: uploadDocument(type, stream)
    activate Entry

    Entry->>State: upload(this, type, stream)
    activate State

    Note right of State: 3. Business Logic & Storage
    State->>Store: saveFile(path, stream)
    State->>Entry: markSlotFilled(type)
    State->>Entry: validate() (Trigger Rule Engine)

    deactivate State
    deactivate Entry

    Note right of Cmd: 4. Persistence via DTO
    Cmd->>Entry: toDTO()
    Entry-->>Cmd: ExpenseStateDTO
    Cmd->>Repo: save(ExpenseStateDTO)

    Cmd-->>Service: Success
    deactivate Cmd

    Service-->>Client: 200 OK
    deactivate Service